<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>London Seed Radar: week of {{ issue.issue_date }}</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Georgia, serif; max-width: 44rem; margin: 2rem auto;
         padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a1a; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .banner { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #e0c869; padding: .6rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 4px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .meta { color: #666; font-size: .9rem; }
  a { color: #0b5394; }
  footer { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: .85rem; color: #666;
           border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p><a href="../index.html">&larr; London Seed Radar</a></p>
<h1>Week of {{ issue.issue_date }}</h1>
{% if sample_data %}
<p class="banner">Sample data: generated from recorded test fixtures to
demonstrate the pipeline. The companies are fictional.</p>
{% endif %}
<p>{{ entries|length }} newly funded early-stage companies in London this week.</p>

{% for entry in entries %}
<h2>{{ entry.company.name }} <span class="meta">({{ entry.event.stage }}, {{ entry.amount_label }})</span></h2>
<p>{{ entry.company.one_liner }}</p>
<p class="meta">
{% if entry.founders %}
Founders: {% for f in entry.founders %}{{ f.name }}{% if f.role %} ({{ f.role }}){% endif %}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.
{% endif %}
Team: est. {{ entry.company.headcount_estimate or "unknown" }}.
{% if entry.jobs %}
Hiring: {{ entry.jobs|length }} live role(s){% if entry.company.website %}, <a href="{{ entry.company.website }}">site</a>{% endif %}.
{% elif entry.company.ats_status == "unverifiable" %}
Hiring: board exists, public API disabled, unverifiable.
{% endif %}
Evidence: {% for e in entry.evidence %}<a href="{{ e.url }}">{{ e.source_name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.
</p>
{% endfor %}

<footer>
Names, public roles, and public filings only; no personal contact data.
Amounts from filings are best-effort. Corrections welcome via GitHub issues.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
